  "label": "White Trash Stereotype",
  "description": "A derogatory stereotype that refers to people of lower socioeconomic status, particularly those perceived as poor, uneducated, and lacking in moral or social refinement. It is often used to demean individuals based on their appearance, behavior, or assumed lifestyle, and is rooted in class-based prejudice and racialized assumptions about rural or working-class populations, particularly white people.",
